   "source": [
    "## 5. Phan tich phan du (Residual Analysis)\n",
    "\n",
    "### 5.1 Tai sao phan tich phan du?\n",
    "\n",
    "Mo hinh OLS dua tren 4 gia dinh chinh:\n",
    "1. **Tuyen tinh**: $E[y|X] = X\\beta$ (khong co dang phi tuyen bi bo sot)\n",
    "2. **Dong phuong sai** (homoscedasticity): $\\text{Var}(\\varepsilon_i) = \\sigma^2$ voi moi $i$\n",
    "3. **Phan du chuan**: $\\varepsilon \\sim N(0, \\sigma^2 I)$\n",
    "4. **Khong co quan sat ngoai le** co anh huong lon (influential points)\n",
    "\n",
    "**4 bieu do chuan** de kiem tra tung gia dinh:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Bieu do | Gia dinh kiem tra | Dau hieu vi pham |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| Residuals vs Fitted | Tuyen tinh, dong phuong sai | Xu huong cong, pheu mo rong |\n",
    "| Normal Q-Q Plot | Chuan cua phan du | Diem lech khoi duong thang |\n",
    "| Scale-Location | Dong phuong sai (homoscedasticity) | Duong xu huong khong nam ngang |\n",
    "| Cook's Distance | Quan sat anh huong lon | Thanh vuot nguong $4/n$ |\n",
    "\n",
    "### 5.2 Cac cong thuc\n",
    "\n",
    "**Phan du tho:** $e_i = y_i - \\hat{y}_i$\n",
    "\n",
    "**MSE:** $\\hat{\\sigma}^2 = \\dfrac{\\sum e_i^2}{n - p - 1}$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Phan du chuan hoa:**\n",
    "$$r_i = \\frac{e_i}{\\hat{\\sigma}}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Hat matrix diagonal (leverage):**\n",
    "$$h_{ii} = x_i^T (X^TX)^{-1} x_i$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Cook's Distance:**\n",
    "$$D_i = \\frac{e_i^2}{p \\cdot \\hat{\\sigma}^2} \\cdot \\frac{h_{ii}}{(1 - h_{ii})^2}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Nguong: $D_i > 4/n$ → quan sat $i$ co anh huong lon."
   ]
  },
