    "## 6. Cross-Validation (K-Fold CV)\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6.1 Tai sao can Cross-Validation?\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Overfitting**: mo hinh khop tot training data nhung du bao kem tren data moi.\n",
    "- $R^2$ training **luon tang** khi them bien, khong phan anh kha nang tong quat hoa.\n",
    "- **Cross-Validation** uoc luong **loi du bao ngoai mau** mot cach dang tin cay hon.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6.2 Cong thuc K-Fold Cross-Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Chia du lieu** thanh $k$ phan (fold) bang nhau:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\text{CV}(k) = \\frac{1}{k} \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\text{MSE}_i, \\quad \\text{MSE}_i = \\frac{1}{|\\mathcal{V}_i|} \\sum_{j \\in \\mathcal{V}_i} (y_j - \\hat{y}_j^{(-i)})^2$$\n",
    "\n",
    "- $\\mathcal{V}_i$: tap validation fold $i$\n",
    "- $\\hat{y}_j^{(-i)}$: du bao tu mo hinh hoc tren $k-1$ fold con lai\n",
    "\n",
    "**Lua chon $k$:**\n",
    "- $k = 5$ hoac $k = 10$: pho bien nhat\n",
    "- $k = n$ (LOOCV): it lech nhung ton kem tinh toan\n",
    "- $k$ nho: bias cao, variance thap; $k$ lon: bias thap, variance cao\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6.3 So sanh mo hinh qua CV\n",
    "\n",
    "| Mo hinh | CV Score (MSE) | Nhan xet |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| OLS don gian (1 bien) | CV$_1$ | Underfitting |\n",
    "| OLS dung (2 bien) | CV$_2$ | Tham chieu |\n",
    "| OLS qua nhieu bien | CV$_3$ | Nguy co overfitting |\n",
    "| Ridge ($\\lambda^*$) | CV$_{ridge}$ | Regularization giam phuong sai |\n",
    "\n",
    "→ Chon mo hinh co **CV Score thap nhat**."
   ]
  },
